{"hw":"ἐθέλω","html":"<div class=\"lex-entry\"><h4 class=\"lex-hw gk\">ἐθέλω</h4><span class=\"lex-orth gk\">ἐθέλω</span> or <span class=\"lex-orth gk\">θέλω</span> (v. infr.), <span class=\"lex-gram\"> <span class=\"lex-gram\">Ep.</span> </span> <span class=\"lex-gram\">subj.</span> <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"1\"><span class=\"lex-n\">A</span> <span class=\"gk\">ἐθέλωμι</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Il.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">1.549</span> </span>,<span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">9.397</span> </span>: <span class=\"lex-gram\">impf.</span> <span class=\"gk\">ἤθελον</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">14.120</span> </span>, etc.; <span class=\"lex-gram\"> <span class=\"lex-gram\">Ep.</span> </span> and Lyr. <span class=\"gk\">ἔθελον</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">6.336</span> </span>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Thgn.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">606</span> </span>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">B.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">10.73</span> </span>; <span class=\"lex-gram\"> <span class=\"lex-gram\">Ion.</span> </span> <span class=\"gk\">ἐθέλεσκον</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Il.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">13.106</span> </span>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Hdt.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">6.12</span> </span>: <span class=\"lex-gram\">fut.</span> <span class=\"gk\">ἐθελήσω</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Il.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">18.262</span> </span>, etc.; <span class=\"gk\">θελήσω</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Antipho</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">5.99</span> </span>: <span class=\"lex-gram\">aor. 1</span> <span class=\"gk\">ἠθέλησα</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span cl